 "_crafted": "public/sprites/crafted/*.webp, indexed by src/lib/sprites/crafted.json. Indexed per LEVEL like a structure, because the game redraws a Crafted Defense as it upgrades - but BANDED: the four pictures cover levels 3-11, 12-20, 21-29 and 30, so the index holds one entry per band and a level with no entry uses the highest below it. A separate index from the structures, because a Crafted Defense is not a building: it is what the Crafting Station turns into, and its set is replaced every four months, so a retired one can be dropped without touching structure art.",
